dies containing as the active ingredient 1-formyl-N-(2-(4-(5H-dibenzo[a,d]cyclo-hepten-5-ylidene)-1-piperidinyl))ethylisonipecotamide or analogues thereof as represented by general formula (1), or pharmaceutically acceptable salts of both, wherein n is an integer of 2 or 3; Y is hydrogen or halogeno; and X is formyl, acetyl or hydrogen.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne des remèdes contre la claudication intermittente, contenant, en tant que principe actif, du 1-formyl-N-(2-(4-(5H-dibenzo[a,d]cyclohepten-5-ylidène)-1-pipéridinyl))éthylisonipécotamide ou des analogues de celui-ci, conformément à la formule générale (1), ou des sel des deux, acceptables au plan pharmaceutique. Dans ladite formule (1), n vaut 2 ou 3 ; Y représente hydrogène ou halogéno ; et X représente formyle, acétyle ou hydrogène.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>